<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-18T06:09:44.180Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 06:09:44 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF drones have hit a market in Nyala, killing at least 30 civilians, and have also attacked an artisanal gold mine in South Kordofan. The Sudanese army has carried out a drone strike that killed four civilians in West Kordofan and says it killed dozens of RSF fighters in a separate Nyala attack, while an ammunition depot explosion in northern Khartoum caused panic and damaged homes. Al-Burhan sent a message to the German chancellor urging peace efforts and invited the African Human Rights Commission, warning against continued RSF support. UN officials are urging an immediate halt to drone strikes and greater pressure to end the war. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1DdVo0cVRncXRWb0Q0Y3dvM0QxZEtFZGd4eFQwRUQwTllWZDBjZ0FYMkpHdGNKNUw3ZnZkRnoxOFVZUWdFU3N2T0JpOWV4TUpKVE5RVDFRWnlEZ9IBX0FVX3lxTE84YkRGMTBGYkdwNmszTGJnMURCN1pCZTJOWHYyTGFVQ21JbHdyQnVSUE5OMS1ySHJMSTJlYmhnaFFQV2xDcXNiNE9SUndNUDZuRk01TXRQaURHRmVET2pJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1wYzRmVEpmMlgtTlhBWjBvT3JjRFdOaWVXVjQ2RVo5eW5JOTBRZHFnMHZ4ck9HcXlnelpCWmNhTWRFZy1GUTg3ZF9vc0xSb242?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE1LajNTaDAzT09MWk1FVk82cV9lb1k2bUNKT2pyV1ZKVC15TlMxYlVmS0huVVpyRXNYLWtTRnd1MHo5UktaQ1hib1A2aklOcDVk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPTXdncDl5NXZuVXFWcVRQRUo4UmVwR09ER3RfMUZNclNONkI2akNGazJFN01IMjQxQzljZTBpOE9aalN2eXhhYUVMMmJLdEVzcTVla0tNeDNvZ0RqSE01bUM4VkJFRjdlNk1zUGhfRzdpRlNYMUlVU1pjakZVZzNIVWVfbHgtMVY1S1VRMVd3SjBrYVNrNmVfRE9CNzlCcEtuMzJsen